            "review_title": "Review at Jinro BBQ",
            "review_text": "Stanley H\nHong Kong, China11208 contributions\n1\nKorean fever in Hanoi\nDec 2024 • Family\nThe day of returning to Hanoi, it was Easter. Evening attractions and dining place in the busiest old town. So, it's not easy to drill in. This is also a meal we celebrate New Year's Day. That night, we came to one of the most central places in the Old Town. To taste, it is a Korean barbecue. A restaurant called \"Jinro BBQ\", the owner is a Korean who lives in Hanoi. That night, because it was the grand Easter party, the boss personally arrived and greeted everyone.\n\nYes, this is also the last dinner of our trip to Vietnam. Unexpectedly, this meal is a delicious meal. In addition to beverages, meat and seafood are all available. And this, this restaurant, is a popular shop with visitors, with the staff in English, zero questions. It's just that night it was Christmas Eve and the restaurant was very busy.\n\nThe first was a vegetarian food prepared for my wife. Seafood soup, sauce and peanut is the vegetarian food that this meat-based restaurant can serve.\n\nThen the shopkeeper brought all the sauces along with the front dish. With time, we filled our counter. Then, there's probably a shopkeeper screaming carefully. So they put the red coal furnace in.\n\nThe ordinary gas furnace, the oil gas furnace of the Korean burn eat much more. Burned with charcoal, it is also really the first time to eat.\n\nThe shopkeeper set a good oven, slowly put the rice eggs, and some mushroom foods are placed next to it. It also indicates that we can start to bake meat.\n\nBut because one of our four people has two children. The shopkeepers for safety, they also helped us allocate meat to bake. Beef steak, pork steak and pork steak, are all large pieces.\n\nIn a moment, it will be baked. The shopkeeper also carefully helped us cut. Afterwards, more and more guests, the shopkeeper came to the seafood end, and went busy. The son can finally happily grill his own meat.\n\nAfter the meat is baked, we take the pre-allocated seafood food to bake. By the master of the son, he cleverly cooked eight-tailed fish to a thorough, each one.\n\nAfter that, steak. Strawberry is a simple procedure, and after the one side turns red, the other side can be baked.\n\nHappy eating and drinking photos are gone. In short, meat and seafood taste sweet and beautiful. Then, when we were not full enough, we added more meat and continued in the center of Hanoi to bake meat.\n\nThat night, the atmosphere was good, because it was year-round. However, if we are not afraid of getting out of the city centre after the start of the annual party, we might stay at the restaurant for a while and eat slowly. This time little rushed to eat, a little lost the atmosphere of eating Korean. But, overall, it is indeed a delicious store.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten June 5, 2025",
